===Etymology===
Probably {{etyl|it}} (dial. [[Lombardy]]) {{term|arigola|lang=it}}. (Eng. usg. 1967)

Cognate to {{term|rocket#Etymology 2|rocket|(the plant)|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{enPR|əʹro͞ogələ}}, {{IPA|/əˈɹuɡələ/}}, {{SAMPA|/@"rug@l@/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|pl2=arugula}}

# A yellowish-flowered [[Mediterranean]] [[herb]] of the [[mustard]] family; which has flavoured leaves, often eaten in [[salad]]s.

====Synonyms====
* [[rugola]], [[rugula]]
* [[garden rocket]]
* [[rocket#Etymology 2|rocket]]
